// The default company logo, embedded (generated from images/Logo 123.jpg).
// When index.html is opened straight from disk (file://) the browser treats images/… as a foreign
// file and refuses to let it into a PDF ("Tainted canvases may not be exported"). A script is not
// subject to that rule, so the PDF builder takes the logo from here. Regenerate if the logo changes.
window.FG_DEFAULT_LOGO = 'data:image/jpeg;base64,';
